### Criar um Monstro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Goblin Saqueador",
  "type": "MONSTER",
  "lore": "Uma criatura vil que se esconde nas sombras das cavernas.",
  "image_url": "https://url-do-supabase.com/goblin.png",
  "stats": {
    "hp": 15,
    "strength": 8,
    "dexterity": 14,
    "AC": 10,
    "actions": ["Mordida", "Facada"]
  }
}

###

### Buscar um Monstro por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities/1
Accept: application/json


### Test with all fields:
### Criar um Monstro (Boss com Ficha D&D Completa)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Senhor da Podridão",
  "type": "MONSTER",
  "lore": "Um antigo necromante de Lamúria que transcendeu a morte. Ele governa as catacumbas e sussurra nos pesadelos dos habitantes da superfície.",
  "image_url": "https://url-do-supabase.com/lich-podridao.png",
  "stats": {
    "armor_class": 17,
    "hit_points": "135 (18d8 + 54)",
    "speed": "9 m.",
    "attributes": {
      "STR": 11,
      "DEX": 16,
      "CON": 16,
      "INT": 20,
      "WIS": 14,
      "CHA": 16
    },
    "saving_throws": ["CON +9", "INT +11", "WIS +8"],
    "skills": ["Arcana +11", "History +11", "Perception +8"],
    "damage_resistances": ["Cold", "Lightning", "Necrotic"],
    "damage_immunities": ["Poison", "Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing from Nonmagical Attacks"],
    "condition_immunities": ["Charmed", "Exhaustion", "Frightened", "Paralyzed", "Poisoned"],
    "senses": ["Truesight 36 m.", "Passive Perception 18"],
    "languages": ["Abyssal", "Common", "Infernal"],
    "challenge_rating": "21 (33,000 XP)",
    "actions": [
      {
        "name": "Toque Paralisante",
        "type": "Melee Spell Attack",
        "hit": "+12",
        "reach": "2 m.",
        "damage": "10 (3d6) cold damage",
        "effect": "O alvo deve passar em um teste de CON (DC 18) ou ficará paralisado por 1 minuto."
      }
    ],
    "legendary_actions": [
      {
        "name": "Olhar Aterrorizante (Custa 2 Ações)",
        "effect": "Fixa o olhar em uma criatura a até 10 metros. A criatura deve passar em um teste de WIS (DC 18) ou ficará assustada."
      }
    ]
  }
}

### Adicionar a "Lâmina Sugadora de Almas" (ID 2) aos drops do "Senhor da Podridão" (ID 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities/2/drops/2

###

### Get monster
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities/2
Accept: application/json

### Listar todas as Entidades
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/entities
Accept: application/json